      voice = "est_10062_1.mp3"
    },
    [2] = {
      uid = 130,
      next = 3,
      beijing = 2030,
      sentence = [[
Fate is really a wonderful thing. Not long after I recalled my old friend, I met his daughter, along with the cold young man, whom she called Victor.

But the Victor that day was very different from the Victor of the first meeting. I thought he was a frozen pool of water, accompanied by long nights and late winters. Even the warm spring breeze could not disturb him.

Unexpectedly, in the presence of that girl, his expressions were vivid and full of life, like a flowing stream after the ice had melted.
]],
      music = "11_Sorrow_LongEnding_Ver",
      voice = "est_10062_2.mp3"
    },
    [3] = {
      uid = 131,
      next = 4,
      beijing = 2030,
      sentence = [[
So I could probably guess why he wanted to confirm so many things with me, and tried so hard to find the truth.

It's nice to be young.

Before they left, I gave them the box that had remained unopened for a long time.

The content of the box was just a souvenir that was no longer useful to me. But for these two young people... Maybe it could help them change their fate.

"Kids, as long as you've got time, everything can still change. Time is the future."
]],
      music = "11_Sorrow_LongEnding_Ver",
      voice = "est_10062_3.mp3"
    },
