      next = 2,
      beijing = 3530,
      sentence = [[
But it wasn't until much, much later that I seemed to be able to understand Victor's decision.

Time was the source of all meanings. It also marked the end of them.

Flowers blossom and wither. Stars move across the sky. Civilizations rise and fall. Even the universe will eventually collapse... But none of these were representative of the dimensions of time.

]],
