      uid = 954,
      next = 3,
      beijing = 3530,
      sentence = [[
On the contrary, they only carried meaning when measured by time.

That which we had spent an entire lifetime to find meant nothing to time. Every member of the Spacetime Bureau believed this, so we naturally expected Victor to feel the same.

But he was different.

Nobody understood Victor's obsession with meanings. They often carefully predicted his actions, and secretly planned many paths to guide him.
]],
      music = "23_Lonely",
      voice = "est_10113_2.mp3"
    },
    [3] = {
      uid = 955,
      next = 4,
      beijing = 3530,
      sentence = [[
