He was looking for her. And he was determined to find her.

If we were to use her as a bargaining chip, he would be willing to accept a fate full of drastic changes.

Despite having found a breaking point, the situation was still deeply troubling. She shouldn't have survived in the first place, nor should she have been sent to other worlds - that would only further disrupt the timelines. It had never been done before. No one had that ability.
]],
      music = "23_Lonely",
      voice = "est_10113_3.mp3"
    },
    [4] = {
