"Every minor change in the timelines will cause a butterfly effect somewhere else. It may be positive or negative, but 90% of the time it will be negative... Yes, we do keep track of these statistics."

"The job of the Spacetime Bureau is to maintain the stability of all worlds across all timelines."
]],
      music = "23_Lonely",
      voice = "est_10113_6.mp3"
    },
    [7] = {
      uid = 959,
      next = 8,
      beijing = 3530,
      sentence = [[
