      sentence = "A long time ago, Loveland city had become an island isolated from the outside world… a place where even Time Observers could not travel in and out freely, except for Victor.\n\nZero was not able to interfere with the anomalies in this timeline. All he could do was to warm Victor again and again, that if he disregarded the trajectory of the worlds, then he was bound to pay the price—\n\nFrom then on, every time he used his power caused massive damage to himself and to his time.\n",
