      sentence = "Shattered images flashed past his eyes like streams of light—the sinking ground and the flooded city...\n\nThe unchangeable future and the past he witnessed countless times appeared before him with each step forward.\n\nHis Adam's apple slid up and down. Victor remained silent for a long time while his gaze fell on the flashing images.\n\nHe saw the girl leaning on his shoulder fast asleep, the blanket slowly slipping off her shoulders, and the snow sprinkling the earth silently outside the window.\n",
