      sentence = "One week after the experiment.\n\nThe circumstances were beyond our anticipations: in the thirty hours after Gavin woke up, his mind plunged into chaos while his modified Evol became beyond control, destroying the entire lab at one point.\n\nFortunately, he recovered after a certain point in time. But he lost his emotions and became extremely cold, just as we imagined—he became the most powerful \"weapon\".\n",
